# shadcn UI

Inventory installed primitives before proposing custom components. Reuse and
compose existing accessible primitives; do not assume a registry component is
installed. Preserve project tokens, import conventions, keyboard behavior,
focus management, and responsive layout. Do not apply presets or overwrite
theme files without human approval.
